1.9.8 rule: bonus_pick_random_type rerolls Fire Bullets while any player, dead or alive, holds a weapon whose shot
sound is the flamer, rocket or rocket-minigun one. The original compares loaded sound ids, which tell the sounds apart
only with every sound loaded: the verifier loads none, and the original without sound or assets gives every sound one
id. The run compares the sounds' audio_asset_id_table slots instead (host/rules.h), as a run with its sounds loaded
tells them apart.
--- a/decomp/1.9/crimsonland/gameplay/bonus_pick_random_type.cpp
+++ b/decomp/1.9/crimsonland/gameplay/bonus_pick_random_type.cpp
@@ -3,7 +3,6 @@
-#if CL_BUILD == 10908
+// The shot sounds 1.9.8's Fire Bullets reroll looks for.
 extern "C" {
 extern int sfx_flamer_fire_01;
 extern int sfx_rocket_fire;
 extern int sfx_rocketmini_fire;
 }
-#endif
@@ -92,18 +91,17 @@
